This repository’s *code and documentation* are Apache-2.0, matching the
Laya / mmBERT base.

These **weights** were not trained on facebook/xnli. They were trained on
MIRACL-ar train (cite Zhang et al. 2023), a MASSIVE-ar cap (CC BY 4.0),
and **unreleased** in-house Arabic fatwa search logs. The logs, corpus,
teacher ranks, and human gold questions are **not** licensed by this file
and must not be redistributed from a copy of this repository.

See NOTICE.md and DATA.md.
